abstract: >-
  Papers and results for FRM, the Felix Runtime Module, a bounded recursive
  self-improvement runtime tested as FELIX-C3 against a published Level-4
  definition, together with a companion preregistered study of transfer to
  real bugs from QuixBugs and HumanEvalFix.
keywords:
  - recursive self-improvement
  - self-referential improvement
  - capability taxonomy
  - autonomous operation
  - preregistration
  - automated program repair
  - external validity
